## Original Content
A deepdive on what&#8217;s changed in how the leading AI lab makes software. Ever more code review and testing is done by AI, two-pizza teams very much alive, and more. Details from inside of Anthropic

## Summary
The article explores the evolution of software development practices at Anthropic, emphasizing the increased role of AI in code review and testing. It also notes that Anthropic continues to use small, efficient team structures referred to as 'two-pizza teams.'

## Key Points
- AI is taking over more software development tasks, such as code review and testing.
- Anthropic maintains small team structures for efficiency and agility.
- The article provides insider insights into changes in software engineering at a leading AI lab.
- The 'two-pizza teams' concept remains central to Anthropic's operations.


